{
averages
{
type fieldAverage;
libs (fieldFunctionObjects);
writeControl writeTime;
writeInterval 1;
timeStart 0.1;
executeControl timeStep;
executeInterval 1;
restartOnRestart true;
fields
(
U { mean yes; prime2Mean yes; base time; }
p { mean yes; prime2Mean no; base time; }
);
}
}
示例 3 · 每次输出后重新统计
按相邻两次输出之间的时间段分别求平均，可比较不同时段的流动。
