配置示例
示例 1 · 基本配置
functions
{
writeDictionaryExample
{
type writeDictionary;
libs (utilityFunctionObjects);
dictNames (controlDict fvSchemes fvSolution);
writeControl writeTime;
}
}
writeDictionary 用于监测并输出指定字典的内容。dictNames=(controlDict fvSchemes fvSolution)，需要输出和监测的字典名称列表。结果随主计算的写出时刻保存。
示例 2 · 只记录离散设置
用于比较不同离散格式的运行日志。
functions
{
writeDictionaryExample
{
type writeDictionary;
libs (utilityFunctionObjects);
dictNames (fvSchemes);
writeControl writeTime;
}
}
示例 3 · 记录求解和时间控制
把线性求解容差与时间控制保存在同一份日志中。
functions
{
writeDictionaryExample
{
type writeDictionary;
libs (utilityFunctionObjects);
dictNames (fvSolution controlDict);
writeControl writeTime;
}
}
